<h1>Third-party licenses</h1>
<p>FinderMaxxing uses the Qt framework under the GNU LGPL v3, linked dynamically. You may replace the Qt
libraries shipped with this application with your own build; see the Qt notice in the application bundle.</p>
<h2>Overview</h2>
<ul>
{{#each overview}}
